title: Panels fixture
---

# Panels

A tab set and a code group, the two constructs whose panels a stylesheet can
hide outright. Each panel body carries a unique word so an extracted PDF or a
rendered page can be asked whether the panel reached the reader at all.

:::: tabs

::: tab [Alpha]
PANELBODYALPHA in the first tab.
:::

::: tab [Beta]
PANELBODYBETA in the second tab.
:::

::::

::: code-group
``` php [one.php]
echo 'PANELBODYGAMMA';
```
``` js [two.js]
console.log('PANELBODYDELTA');
```
:::
